    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "I often go to Solaceon Town for my big\n",
        "brother.\r",
        "The newspaper there gives me Heart\n",
        "Scales for running errands."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Guru’s Dojo!\n",
        "How can I enhance your Pokémon?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00019",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon needs my help?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "I can awaken its {STRVAR_1 24, 0, 0} Ability!\n",
        "My services will cost {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0}.\f",
        "Do we have a deal?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you are the Pokémon Champion!\n",
        "I’ll awaken {STRVAR_1 24, 0, 0} for free.\f",
        "Shall I proceed?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Done!\n",
        "Your Pokémon’s hidden potential\f",
        "has been fully awakened!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry, but you don’t have\n",
        "enough money for my services.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm... you lack experience.\n",
        "Come back when you have 4 Badges.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000140_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "This Pokémon already possesses a\n",
        "unique Ability.\f",
        "There’s nothing else I can do.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
